<title>USA: U.S. zinc stocks up in April - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. zinc stocks up in April - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total U.S. slab zinc stocks held by smelters rose to 8,586 short tons at the end of April compared to 7,839 short tons at the end of March, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Zinc production fell to 20,062 short tons in April from a total of 21,426 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>Shipments from smelters' plants also fell to 19,535 short tons in the month from a March total of 20,467 short tons .</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
